  "description": "Is the Puppet infrastructure the reason Puppet is unwell? Reads node_exporter, scoped to hosts labelled pe_infrastructure=\"true\", which pdctng::node_exporter sets off the pe_build fact. Deliberately not the whole fleet: for an individual agent, import Grafana 1860. Set pdctng::node_exporter::pe_infrastructure explicitly on an infrastructure host that runs no PE server software, the monitoring node being the one that matters. The PE selector filters hosts that carry a pe label; hosts without one, which is what a node_exporter you manage yourself looks like, stay on the board whatever is selected rather than disappearing from it."
}
